{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"一、十年，春王二月，公會齊侯、鄭伯于中丘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"二、夏，翬帥師會齊人、鄭人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"此公子翬也。何以不稱公子？貶。曷為貶？隱之罪人也。故終隱之篇貶也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"三、六月壬戌，公敗宋師于菅。辛未取郜，辛巳取防。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"取邑不日，此何以日？一月而再取也。何言乎一月而再取？甚之也。內大惡諱，此其言甚之何？春秋錄內而略外，於外大惡書，小惡不書，於內大惡諱，小惡書。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"四、秋，宋人、衞人入鄭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"五、宋人、蔡人、衞人伐載，鄭伯伐取之。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"其言伐取之何？易也。其易奈何？因其力也。因誰之力？因宋人、蔡人、衞人之力也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_10_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_10","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月壬午，齊人、鄭人入盛。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}